{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It doesn't matter. What does matter is the power over life and death itself. Does not seem, natural.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:14:12.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869417365656440832","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It was my old body\" he says just loud enough to be heard \"it was dug up... and put to horrible work\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:15:13.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869417620414275654","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Thats terrible. \"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:15:40.946000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869417734671310928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"So we did have tea! I knew it, you look... better.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:15:41.809000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869417738291015700","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I didn't have tea with you... but I saw you with tea when I was brought back... so I assume that is what you speak of\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:16:40.507000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869417984488263680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Earl grey, darjeeling, it's all tea to me.\" Cairn says as if to indicate he is indifferent to the syntax.","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:18:16.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869418388743659591","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"So how do you do it?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:18:42.878000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869418497749422121","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“What… brought it back…?”","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:18:47.474000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869418517026463815","reply_to_id":"869417620414275654","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yes.... I was dead a very long time.... and as a favor to the feather and scales, I was brought back.  Items representing my life were gathered, but as long as my corpse walked, I couldn't come back....\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:20:04.371000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869418839555833867","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"ah I see.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:20:28.545000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869418940948967424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"As for natural order.... is this war natural?  The deaths it has?  I bring back noone that was not cut short unnaturally\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:21:21.513000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869419163112833025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Feather and scales? Do you speak of Jazirian, perhaps?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:21:47.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869419274064773180","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He looks at a good berry in his hand, studying it long and hard","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:21:49.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869419279156641863","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
